//! Automatic composition of short tunes.
//!
//! This crate started as a port of a TypeScript implementation, which it reproduced exactly up to
//! commit 83edec0. Since then it has its own random numbers, parameter format and fixes, and the
//! golden fixtures (`fixtures/golden/`) are generated by this crate
//! (`cargo run --example gen_golden`). The TypeScript implementation was removed from the
//! repository after commit ece5a07.

